{"id":1040804,"chapter_id":1040804,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"一伙举着奇怪武器的人破开大门就冲了进来，你警惕地想要后退，却发现他们的目标似乎并不是你——这群人直奔柯琳而去。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"老年男性","content":"柯琳！太好了，你没事！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"黑压压的人影中，老弱病残一应俱全，围绕着柯琳该哭的哭，该骂的骂。房间内一时间喧闹起来。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"老年男性","content":"哎呦你这个不让人省心的，你知道我们有多担心吗？还闯人家管理局！平常怎么没见你这么能耐，啊？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"哎呀，放轻松点嘛镇长，你就是因为担心的事情太多才会老的快的。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"你看，苏珊奶奶比你年纪大那么多，精气神可比你好得多——哎呦！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"话还没说完，柯琳就结结实实吃了一记爆栗。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"年老女人","content":"你这个死孩子，是不是以为自己很了不起！啊？！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"年老女人","content":"逞英雄很爽是吧？！认为我们老家伙都是废物，需要被你护在翅膀下头罩着了——是吧？！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"满脸皱纹的老妇腰侧挂着双枪，弹匣满载，表情愤慨非常。她的巴掌落在柯琳背上，每一下都发出极其响亮的声音……与你想象中的“老弱病残图科人”有不小差距。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"柯琳作势要躲，动作却没有抵抗的意思，虽然满嘴讨饶，不过脸上却始终带着笑容。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"没、没——哎呦！真没有啊，苏珊奶奶！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我哪敢瞧不起您啊，您带我的时候我还是个满地乱爬的傻子呢……哎哟，好疼啊……！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"看向绕着自己团团转的人群，她双手合十，眨巴着眼睛。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我保证，我和你们保证，这种事情再也没有第二次了，真的！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"人群又骚动起来，对柯琳这种敷衍的道歉十分不满。被称为镇长的男人扒开人群，扬声说道。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"镇长","content":"好了好了，大家都消消气！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"镇长","content":"该找的人已经找到了，收拾一下，咱们准备撤退！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"说罢他转头看向你，有点疑惑，似乎不知道你是哪位。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"咳咳，请允许我介绍一下——这位就是堂堂MBCC的正牌局长，小海拉口中的超级大英雄，${PlayerName}！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"男人呆愣地看了你两秒，又转头看向柯琳。在柯琳又重重点了点头之后，镇长大叫出声。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"镇长","content":"柯琳！！你又惹上什么麻烦了！！！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"镇长","content":"哎呦我的狄斯大老爷……这个，不知道咱们孩子又犯了什么事儿，但肯定都是她的错！您放心，我们回去肯定狠狠管教她！再也不放出来丢人现眼了！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"options":["她说她绑架了海拉","她瞒着你们潜入了MBCC"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804024,"trial_step":24,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"她说她绑架了海拉","goto":25},{"text":"她瞒着你们潜入了MBCC","goto":null}]},{"step":25,"content":"此时不告状还要等什么时候？你从头顺了一遍柯琳的“罪行”，镇长越听脸越黑，到最后甚至连气都生不出，狠狠瞪了柯琳一眼，转头向你赔罪。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"镇长","content":"海拉什么海拉！放*，海拉那丫头早跟着军团走了，您别听柯琳在这胡扯！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"镇长","content":"咳咳，如果您不介意的话，可以和我们一起行动，我们会优先把您送回您的伙伴身边。就当是为了柯琳的冒失赔罪！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"options":["你们打算横穿沙暴？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你们打算横穿沙暴？","goto":29}]},{"step":29,"content":"沙暴还没有结束，你们打算横穿沙暴离开？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"镇长","content":"呵呵，这个您不用担心。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"——哇，这是哪儿弄来的砂艇？新型号？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"门外传来柯琳的声音，她似乎看到了什么宝贝，兴致勃勃地品评着。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"莱特","content":"路上跟个“好心人”借的，怎么样，好使吧！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"莱特","content":"不只是这辆破铜烂铁的好宝贝，你看，我们还有这些——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"你走向门口，正好看到一辆几乎冲进门的小砂船，以及一个满脸得意的中年男人。他鬼鬼祟祟地拉开座椅，一层幽幽的蓝光反射上来，照亮了他的整张脸。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"你与镇长重新视线交汇，他对你露出一个微笑。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"镇长","content":"别担心，我们有自己应对危险的方法——即使会有点奇怪，但土法子，总是最好用的。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"图科人的老弱病残不是作假……可真正的“老弱病残”能在砂海平安地混这么久？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"你很快意识到，自己还是太小瞧他们了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"各位乘客，前方路段颠簸，请系好安全带扶稳坐好——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"滚热的风吹拂在脸上，横冲直撞的砂艇破开沙暴，逃出生天。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"黄沙褪去，周遭的景色终于清晰起来，显露出原本的模样。砂艇上的几人因为刚刚过于颠簸的驾驶体验，脸色都不太好……只有站在船头的柯琳满脸笑容，笑嘻嘻地看着其他人。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"这么完美的驾驶技术，不愧是我~","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"苏珊奶奶","content":"臭丫头，给我好好开！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"苏珊奶奶","content":"你和那位局长大人一起待了这么段时间，是一点儿好都没学啊，你看人家多懂礼貌！刚刚还和我说谢谢呢！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"吵嚷声不绝于耳，你回忆起刚刚沙暴中那场搏斗——刚刚你围观了一场精彩的“图科人大战砂兽”，这群人配合默契，甚至不需要你帮忙就迅速解决了挡路的异兽。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"来路不明的砂船，足够好的驾驶技术，还有那些奇怪的武器和战斗方式……","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"柯琳不知道什么时候站到你身边，勾住你的肩膀。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"怎么样？帅不帅！在你们狄斯的大船上可看不到这种景色——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"被风卷起的沙尘直冲向天际，像是快速流动的土黄色的云，很快散去，露出后方一轮烈日。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"她说的没错，确实只有在砂海中才能见到这样丝毫不加遮掩的阳光。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"但……","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"抱歉，我想确认一下。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"你又一次确认周边的景色。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"——不是说会先送我和MBCC的小队汇合吗？为什么我们好像距离狄斯越来越远了？","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"勾住你肩膀的胳膊僵住了一瞬，接着，图科人的笑声从旁侧传来。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"镇长","content":"哎呀！我是这么说过，您记性真好！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"镇长","content":"我就不如您喽，年纪大了，好多事儿都容易忘。您瞧，我刚刚不就忘了说了？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"你在柯琳脸上见过的、嬉皮笑脸的笑容浮现在镇长脸上，他将一张“合同”递到你的面前。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"镇长","content":"我们送您一趟也不容易，您只需要给点车马费，我们立刻就能启程了。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"你转头看向柯琳，她也侧脸看着你。目光相接，她露出一个无辜的笑容。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"别看我啊局长，虽然我很喜欢你，但我到底和他们算是一伙的来着。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"options":["……"],"style":6,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804064,"trial_step":64,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……","goto":65}]},{"step":65,"content":"看来她是帮不上一点忙了。你伸手接过那张霸王条款，人为刀俎我为鱼肉，你似乎并没有太多选择。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"“我、${PlayerName}，MBCC现任局长，以个人名义向图科镇全体镇民发起慈善捐赠，每个季度提供生活物资与补给，并在图科发起紧急求助时派出增补物资……”","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"镇长","content":"也就是每次那么一点狄斯币和异方晶，您给个官方价格，公道点就成。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"“还有向图科提供基础民生保障……”嗯？为什么还要把修砂船单独列出来一条？","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"莱特","content":"哦哦这个！大的那艘船太难修了，总不能每次坏了都去“要塞”那儿再“借”一艘吧——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"砰！莱特被苏珊奶奶狠狠敲了一棍，拖下带走。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"options":["“要塞”？","“借”一艘？"],"style":6,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804071,"trial_step":71,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"“要塞”？","goto":72},{"text":"“借”一艘？","goto":null}]},{"step":72,"content":"柯琳耸耸肩，假装自己什么都没听到。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"……好吧。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"至于这份捐赠的具体金额……嗯？","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"一个意料之外的数字。和柯琳此前踩着线的狮子大开口不同，镇长给出的合同要求额度相当收敛。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"以你所知的图科镇人口规模来推算，这已经是他们维生所需的最低限量。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"莱特","content":"您觉得这个数字少了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"一旁被拖下去的中年男人又忍不住插嘴。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"莱特","content":"哎，我也觉得少，这哪里够用啊！有一张长期饭票多难啊，怎么就不计前嫌地送走了？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"莱特","content":"可我们镇长不这么觉得啊，说“局长是个黑心烂肺的大好人，好得天崩地裂、稀里糊涂、色令智昏——！我们可不能太过分了！”","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"男人倒豆子一般倒出一个个莫名其妙的成语，听得你头晕脑胀。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"options":["……谢谢你的夸奖"],"style":6,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804082,"trial_step":82,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……谢谢你的夸奖","goto":83}]},{"step":83,"content":"看来我没法再拒绝了。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"图科人振奋的欢呼起来，如果不是现在不方便，他们恐怕会抱着你往空中丢。你看向人群中的柯琳，继续说道。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"除此之外，我还有另一份想与你们达成的合作。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"在刚才的“捐赠”外，MBCC还会定期为你们提供一份其他的资源补给。这份补给你们可以自己留下，也可以给其他同样需要异方晶的人，都可以，我不会追究。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"你望向柯琳的眼睛，她似乎有些猜到了你要说什么，表情带着惊讶。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"但作为回报……我希望你们能成为我在这里的眼睛。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"多亏了这次柯琳的“热情邀请”，我才有机会再次来砂海，看到这里最真实的人，也看到这里正在发生的变化。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"那么，我希望我走之后，在我的视线之外仍有人能替我留意这片砂海中的异动。如果你们在砂海听到了、见到了什么奇怪的事情，都可以第一时间联系MBCC，我们会提供等值的报酬。","style":2,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"你说完最后一句话，船上安静了几秒，然后爆发出一阵笑声。柯琳捂着肚子，笑得眼泪都要出来了。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"噗嗤，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……！我还以为你要说什么呢哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"苏珊奶奶","content":"嚯，瞧这小伙子，口气挺大的啊——柯琳，你带回来个了不起的麻烦啊！","female_content":"嚯，瞧这小姑娘，口气挺大的啊——柯琳，你带回来个了不起的麻烦啊！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_93","vo_trial_40804_1_93f"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"是，确实挺麻烦的，但也足够了不起……","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"柯琳擦掉眼角笑出来的泪花，大力拍了拍你的后背。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"放心吧亲爱的，从今天开始，你就不只是我的朋友，而是图科的朋友——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"柯琳重新握紧方向盘，狠狠踩下油门。","style":3,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"走，是时候送我们的好朋友回家了！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"如图科人许诺的一样，你很快就被送回了MBCC小队的驻扎地。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"你离开砂艇，他们依依不舍地围着你拉扯了好一阵，直到柯琳出来驱散才算作罢。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好啦大局长。你也到家了，我也该走了。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"她依靠在砂艇旁边，探出身子，又扔给你一颗糖。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"是过期十天的那种？","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"柯琳狡猾地眨眨眼。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"不，是今天过期的那种。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"不好意思啦，用小海拉钓你出来折腾半天，还害你签了那么没有人性的霸王条款。要不这样，你把我带回MBCC给我封个什么一官半职的，只要有钱拿我什么都能干——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"options":["好了，你也打住"],"style":6,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804108,"trial_step":108,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"好了，你也打住","goto":109}]},{"step":109,"content":"我的委托可不只是发给你的，你们图科所有人都有份。","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"再瞒着他们吃独食的话，估计会被你那位奶奶敲脑壳吧？","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"赏金猎人笑着摇了摇头，为你拍去肩膀上的沙土。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"是啊，下次不会了。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"沙土被掸去，衣服被整理得服帖而整齐，柯琳又顺手拍了拍你的口袋。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好了，这次真的该说再见了。这里是我给你的礼物，等下回去再看~","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"礼物？你是什么时候放进去的？","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"柯琳眨眨眼不说话，转身踏上图科的砂艇。在一阵引擎轰鸣声中，砂艇远去，逐渐消失在扬起的尘土间。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"你摸摸口袋，掏出一个信封来。数十米开外，早早发现你的特遣队员已经迎了上来。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"特遣队员","content":"——局长！不好了！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"他们的脚步很快，表情焦急，带着愧疚和紧张。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"options":["怎么了？"],"style":6,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804120,"trial_step":120,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"怎么了？","goto":121}]},{"step":121,"speaker":"特遣队员","content":"我们的异方晶失窃了！除了少部分队员带在身上的，储藏库里的所有异方晶都被人扒干净了！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"特遣队员","content":"一定是那些给我们带路的人，他们说自己是砂海本地的救援队，专门指引遭遇沙暴的人，只有他们看到过我们拿取异方晶的过程，可……可我们全程都和他们在一起，他们应该没有机会下手才对……","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"options":["……本地人？"],"style":6,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804123,"trial_step":123,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……本地人？","goto":124}]},{"step":124,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"——哇，这是哪儿弄来的砂艇？新型号？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"莱特","content":"路上跟个“好心人”借的，怎么样，好使吧！","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"莱特","content":"不只是这辆破铜烂铁的好宝贝，你看，我们还有这些——","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"你立刻转身，图科的砂艇快马加鞭，早已远去，化作地平线上模糊的一个小点。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"一阵急躁的热风吹来，隐约之间你可以听到一些“快点！搞快点！”的残破音节。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"特遣队员","content":"局、局长？您在看什么？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"content":"你低下头，看向手中刚刚拆封的信件。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"content":"——文字歪歪扭扭，正绘声绘色地描述着海拉是怎么被柯琳骗了又骗，最终被坑了个底朝天的。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"options":["没什么"],"style":6,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804132,"trial_step":132,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没什么","goto":133}]},{"step":133,"content":"只是做了笔不知道是否划算的生意。走吧，我们回狄斯。","style":2,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"柯琳倚在船上，看着视线远处慌张的特遣队员，以及站在队员中间那个冷静的灰色影子。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"想雇佣砂海最好的赏金猎人，却只给这点报酬怎么够呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"笨蛋局长啊……果然是个心善嘴软的好人。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"没关系，你做不到的事情我会帮你。我会成为你在砂海的眼睛，帮你监视在砂海发生的一切，而我无法改变的事情，或许你也能找出一种新的解法……","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"不是互相信任的同伴，也不是只论钱财的交易对象。这是一桩最特别的委托，互相成为彼此视野的延伸，去帮对方看清原本看不明晰的道路。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"就让我看看，你能做到什么程度吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40804_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140804139,"trial_step":139}]}